1
00:00:00,218 --> 00:00:02,348
(Penny:)I mean, not to the same people,
but...

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:06,187
There's gotta be someplace special
we could do it.

3
00:00:06,642 --> 00:00:10,682
(Sheldon:)Leonard, where did you envision
marrying Penny?

4
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:14,520
(Leonard:)Will you shut up?

5
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,490
(Raj:)I know how to make it special.

6
00:00:18,695 --> 00:00:22,115
(Howard:)I told you, we are not re-creating
the wedding from The Sound ofMusic.

7
00:00:22,699 --> 00:00:24,909
(Raj:)Yes, you made that brutally
clear to me.

8
00:00:26,161 --> 00:00:27,701
(Raj:)What I was going to suggest is...

9
00:00:27,913 --> 00:00:30,503
...if you're willing
to wait until Sunday morning...

10
00:00:30,707 --> 00:00:33,547
(Raj:)...the Google satellite
will be over Pasadena.

11
00:00:33,752 --> 00:00:36,422
You can have your wedding
photographed from space.

12
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,340
- Whoa.
That's so cool.

13
00:00:38,548 --> 00:00:40,218
- Way to go, Raj.
- I keep telling you.

14
00:00:40,425 --> 00:00:43,635
(Raj:)If I wasn't an astrophysicist,
I would've been a party planner.

15
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,640
It was always a coin-flip.

16
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,690
(Howard:)Okay, so we know
we're gonna do it Sunday morning.

17
00:00:50,894 --> 00:00:54,484
(Howard:)Now we need to find a good place
for the satellite to see us.

18
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:56,150
(Leonard:)How about our roof?

19
00:00:56,566 --> 00:00:58,566
- Oh, I like that.
- That's great.

20
00:00:58,777 --> 00:01:00,027
(Amy:)Oh, my gosh.

